 state←NewStormState
⍝ Returns an empty state for the storm guard.\\
⍝ `signatures`, `counts`, `lastFulls`, `firsts` and `lasts` hold one item per signature: the signature,
⍝ the number of occurrences, the count at which it last got the full treatment, and the times of its
⍝ first and last occurrence. `fulls` holds the times of the most recent full treatments.\\
⍝ All times are seconds since 1970-01-01, UTC.
 state←⎕NS''
 state.signatures←0⍴⊂''
 state.counts←⍬
 state.lastFulls←⍬
 state.firsts←⍬
 state.lasts←⍬
 state.fulls←⍬
